From: AzediZ <145237384+AzediZ@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 14:28:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 107/110] Corporations and chat
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Corp and alliance chat MOTDs are kept in the database and come back
after a restart.  Recruitment adverts work:  they failed to save
(unescaped text, titles over 30 characters, ad IDs too small for the
recruiters table), searches ignored their filters, and a corp's list
showed every corp's adverts.  Creating, updating, deleting and
searching now work;  updates keep the expiry and add days after it.

Fixes rolled in:
- new applications show in the corp's applications list without a
  client restart (applicationDateTime was missing from the update)
- a new member shows in the member list (the join was announced with
  two columns), and Member Tracking no longer calls every member Online
- chat lines with accents, curly quotes or dashes go to the client as
  unicode instead of showing as "â€™"
